# Hub metadata boxes (LOCKED)

Reference: **vBlog aside “On-chain metadata”** and **dApps Metadata** tab boxes.

## Single implementation

- Component: `HubMetadataStatCard` / `HubMetadataStatGrid` in `src/components/hub/HubMetadataStatGrid.tsx`
- Tokens alias only: `TokenStatCard` must wrap `HubMetadataStatCard` (no local chrome)
- Tokens: `src/lib/hub/shellTokens.ts` (`KX_METADATA_STAT_*`)

## Locked look (do not fork)

| Piece | Token / class |
|-------|----------------|
| Surface | `KX_SURFACE_NESTED` (`bg-zinc-50` / dark `white/[0.04]`, border `zinc-200/80` / `zinc-800`) |
| Card | `KX_METADATA_STAT_CARD` (`h-full`, `p-4 sm:p-5`, `rounded-2xl`, `font-sans`) |
| Label | `KX_METADATA_STAT_LABEL` (`text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide` muted) |
| Value | `KX_METADATA_STAT_VALUE` (`text-xl font-semibold`) |
| Accent value | `KX_METADATA_STAT_VALUE_ACCENT` (`--hub-accent`) |
| Dense / tx | `KX_METADATA_STAT_VALUE_LINK` (`text-sm`) |
| Grid | `KX_METADATA_STAT_GRID` (`gap-3`, max 3 cols, `items-stretch`) |
| Stack | `KX_METADATA_STAT_GRID_STACK` (aside On-chain metadata) |
| Leftover 4th | `metadataStatItemSpanClass` full-width when `count % 3 === 1` |

## Forbidden

- Local `rounded-* border bg-*` boxes for the same job
- Different label sizes (`text-[11px]`, `font-black`, etc.)
- `gap-4` / 4-col grids for these metadata boxes
- Wrapping cards in bare divs that break equal height (put span class on the card)
- Restyling padding/fonts when “fixing contrast”

## Scope

dApps Metadata, Games metadata, Tokens Overview / Protocol / Tokenomics / Price / Programmable / Ledger, vBlog On-chain metadata, Covenant metadata, and any new Hub project panels.
